{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/8dcec49d53b50a75414ec86bad3bb75d.avif?t=1768297240\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/e731ffff46b2d48a92c5480b71fc1a94.poster.avif?t=1768297240\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/e731ffff46b2d48a92c5480b71fc1a94.webm?t=1768297240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/e731ffff46b2d48a92c5480b71fc1a94.mp4?t=1768297240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Don\u2019t let the unknown weigh you down, but let it push you forward, no matter where the path leads. Worlds are separated by mystical corridors, and the only way to discover what is at other side is to step through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/7efe88f0bcaaceed60bacb3b9b1a16f6.avif?t=1768297240\" width=692 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/c8496a7918cc3c92c24698d7a3058b0f.avif?t=1768297240\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you wander, you can find different items such as: Main weapons, sub weapons, relics and costumes. With items in your possession build your own loadout to fit your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/e54b9805ea679d234841636c6beab7a2.avif?t=1768297240\" width=768 height=512 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976630?t=1768297240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/aabb4c58ab4390cae0a984732950a786ca39321b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768297240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/c0ded7548de0bfeda4be073f9fd0137842eececa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768297240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/c0ded7548de0bfeda4be073f9fd0137842eececa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768297240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains disturbing imagery, mature themes, and intense narrative elements. The story explores topics such as addiction, manipulation, morally ambiguous violence, and unexpected or tragic character outcomes. The player may choose actions that reflect these themes through the playable character."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976630/extras/8dcec49d53b50a75414ec86bad3bb75d.avif?t=1768297240\" width=1280 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akama